{"date":"1998-06-19","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f4/9d/40188_P423c.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f4/9d/40188_P423c.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f4/9d/40188_P423c.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f4/9d/40188_P423c.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f4/9d/40188_P423c.jpg"},"summary":"花木兰是家中的长女，性格爽朗率真，父母极力想帮女儿找到一个好归宿，可是多次努力未果。此时却收到了北方匈奴侵略的消息，朝廷召集各家各户的壮丁。木兰父亲也在名单之内，木兰不忍年迈残疾的父亲征战沙场，决定割掉长发，偷走父亲的盔甲，决定女扮男装代父从军。花家的祖先为了保护木兰，便派出了心地善良的木须从旁帮忙。从军的过程中，木兰凭着坚强意志，通过了一关又一关的艰苦训练，她的精神也感动了所有战友。就在战况告急的时候，她也被发现了女子的身份。她被遗留在雪地中，而最后也是她的及时出现，顺利协助大军击退了匈奴。\r\n\r\n简介来自豆瓣（https://movie.douban.com/subject/1294833/）。","name":"Mulan","name_cn":"花木兰","tags":[{"name":"迪士尼","count":242,"total_count":19626},{"name":"欧美","count":212,"total_count":86976},{"name":"剧场版","count":175,"total_count":726351},{"name":"童年","count":142,"total_count":93245},{"name":"1998","count":127,"total_count":13254},{"name":"Disney","count":97,"total_count":7592},{"name":"动画电影","count":88,"total_count":43987},{"name":"美国","count":58,"total_count":27212},{"name":"中国元素","count":45,"total_count":878},{"name":"电影","count":35,"total_count":13625},{"name":"古装","count":32,"total_count":294},{"name":"战争","count":29,"total_count":21680},{"name":"历史","count":23,"total_count":18974},{"name":"经典","count":18,"total_count":23164},{"name":"映画","count":10,"total_count":6312},{"name":"原创","count":7,"total_count":622106},{"name":"小说改","count":4,"total_count":160428},{"name":"战斗","count":4,"total_count":473584},{"name":"奇幻","count":3,"total_count":473471},{"name":"1990s","count":3,"total_count":1647},{"name":"美国动画","count":3,"total_count":2283},{"name":"1998年6月","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"喜剧","count":3,"total_count":35552},{"name":"欧美动画","count":3,"total_count":1176},{"name":"Adventure","count":2,"total_count":159},{"name":"90年代","count":2,"total_count":4057},{"name":"Walt_Disney_Animation_Studios","count":2,"total_cou